      {
        "text": "Its ability is to help a Gu Immortal eat fragrance qi and fill their stomach, which is useless when the Gu is used alone. Fang Yuan, who holds a food path inheritance, judges that it can still be paired with other Gu worms to display a useful effect. Before gaining Eat Fragrance, his only food path Immortal Gu is Snack, so the addition reduces his shortage of food path Immortal Gu and is a joyful surprise to him.",
