  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan takes apart Bai He Palace, he obtains two rank six Immortal Gu among its Gu worms: an unnamed wood path one and a food path one named Eat Fragrance. The find is out of his expectations, since none of the Gu worms on You Chan or Qin Bai He themselves were left to him, only the Gu worms that made up the house.",
